286 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Our project aligns with three key United Nations Sustainable Development Goals. First, it supports SDG 4 \(Quality Education\) by providing clear digitized notes for students to study more effectively. Second, it contributes to SDG 9 \(Innovation\) by developing an AI tool for digitizing historical records, modernizing document preservation. Finally, it promotes SDG 10 \(Reduced Inequalities\) by enabling good quality restoration even with low-end cameras, making digital literacy accessible to everyone.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
