314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (In conclusion, we successfully built a U-Net model that effectively restores sharp handwriting from blurred images. To make this technology accessible, we deployed the system via a Gradio interface, allowing anyone to use it easily. For future work, we plan to train the model on real-world blur datasets to improve its robustness and integrate it with OCR for automated text extraction.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
